QuestGuidance.Register("es",244,{
[7777]="7002EE20\n1\tHable con Darmod fuera de la casa de Ingmar en Eaworth\tDarmod está de guardia fuera de la casa del señor Ingmar, en la parte norte de Eaworth. Botulf le indicó que hablara con Darmod, el portero del señor Ingmar, para poder acceder a la Dama Tóla.\n2\tHable con Tóla en la casa de Ingmar en Eaworth\tLa Dama Tóla le espera dentro de su casa, en la parte norte de Eaworth. Debe entrar en la casa del señor Ingmar y hablar con la Dama Tóla.\n",
[7778]="70071E8C\n1\tReach Kindred standing with the Hamât Renewed\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n2\tSpeak to Lumgâna at Mizâdi's encampment\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n",
[7779]="70071E87\n1\tReach Kindred standing with the Kintai of Sul Madásh\tYou honour the Kintai and assist them with the efforts to preserve Adagím. You should return to their settlement of Sul Madásh to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n2\tSpeak with Aralath at Sul Madásh\tYou honour the Kintai and assist them with the efforts to preserve Adagím. You should return to their settlement of Sul Madásh to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n",
[7780]="7006C959\n1\tReach Kindred tier with the Adúrhid\tYour continued assistance with the goals and objective of the Kintai Elves earns you merit among them. They wish to honour your efforts with a gift at Shonith.\n2\tVisit Thridarlan at Shonith to receive a gift\tYour continued assistance with the goals and objective of the Kintai Elves earns you merit among them. They wish to honour your efforts with a gift at Shonith.\n",
[7781]="7006C960\n1\tReach Kindred tier with the Ikorbâni\tYou have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance.\n2\tVisit Kildûg at Iridír to claim a gift\tYou have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance.\n",
[7782]="7006C94F\n1\tReach Kindred tier with the Phetêkari\tVisit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.\n2\tVisit Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate to claim your gift\030Visit a Tale-warden's assistant at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh\tVisit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.\n",
[7783]="70071E91\n1\tReach Kindred standing with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh\tYou stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought.\n2\tSpeak with Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh\tYou stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought.\n",
[7784]="70071E98\n1\tReach Kindred standing with The City of Zajâna\tYou remain true to your word, aiding the City of Zajâna earnestly. You should return to the city to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n2\tSpeak with Alahamâr at Zajâna\tYou remain true to your word, aiding the City of Zajâna earnestly. You should return to the city to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n",
[7785]="7001AD27\n1\tColoca el estandarte de guerra Malledhrim\tLas torres de vigilancia están en Krul Lugu, debajo de la Guardia de Iavassúl\n2\tDefiende el estandarte de los Malledhrim\tLas torres de vigilancia están en Krul Lugu, debajo de la Guardia de Iavassúl. Iavassúl te ha pedido que te apoderes de una de las dos torres de vigilancia de Taur Morvith con un estandarte de los Malledhrim y que la defiendas contra los orcos por un tiempo. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tHabla con Iavassúl en la Guardia de Iavassúl\tIavassúl se encuentra en la Guardia de Iavassúl, sobre Krul Lugu. Habla con Iavassúl sobre tus logros en los campamentos de los orcos.\n",
[7786]="70066D09\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[7787]="70069060\n1\tHabla con Rock\tAl completar esta misión, recibirás una asignación de moneda de intercambio de Marca de Renovación.\n",
[7788]="70068451\n1\tEntrega las hachas picadas en una caja de recolección\030Recoge hachas picadas ([según el diario]/10)\tHas aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas picadas.\n",
[7789]="7004A9DB\n1\tGather supplies\tGather supplies.\n2\tReúne provisiones (total: 8)\tGather supplies.\n3\tBring the supplies to King Elessar's throne room, in Gondor\tA collection box can be found in King Elessar's throne room in Gondor. Bring the supplies to King Elessar's throne room.\n",
