[7808]="70054513\n1\tFind the Kolos Throk socket\tThe Kolos Throk socket can be found somewhere in Minas Morgul. You should take the seal there.\n2\tFind the Kolos Throk socket\tThe Kolos Throk socket can be found somewhere in Minas Morgul. You should take the seal there.\n3\tFind the Kolos Throk component\tThe Kolos Throk component can be found somewhere in Minas Morgul. You should find the component.\n4\tAdd the component to the Kolos Throk socket\tThe Kolos Throk socket can be found in Minas Morgul. You should take the component there.\n5\tCompletado\tYou have completed the Kolos Throk.\n",
